  * func_8086DF58 -> BgBdanSwitch_DrawDList
    deduced, confidence HIGH: places and scales the switch from its wobble
    values and draws the caller's display list

  * D_8086E0E0 -> sTallFocusOffset
    deduced, confidence HIGH: the 140-unit-high point transformed into the
    tall switch's focus position

